WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.360 --> 00:00:05.590
David is derived from the Hebrew word for 'beloved.'

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:08.540
And according to Urban Dictionary is "a formidable foe to normal people."

00:00:08.540 --> 00:00:10.470
Sometimes David likes to ago by "Dave."

00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:11.590
Dave was adopted. 

00:00:11.590 --> 00:00:13.730
The Star of David is a symbol for Judaism.

00:00:13.730 --> 00:00:17.080
David was the king of Israel, who's also the King of Scotland--twice.

00:00:17.080 --> 00:00:22.980
He was born in Jackson, Mississippi, used to have twelve fingers, picked on me in middle school, and started doing stand-up at the age of 17.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:27.150
He was once a radio talk show weatherman, has mad chops on the sax, and has two hearts.

00:00:27.150 --> 00:00:31.720
David is a sex addict. He practices transcendental meditation and his last name is really Jones.

00:00:31.720 --> 00:00:36.500
David is half Korean, runs a CrossFit gym, and has two cats- Edith and Ohio. (meow) 

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.530
David was the best thing about the movie 'Prometheus'.

00:00:38.630 --> 00:00:41.480
He's a famous singer in Germany and he has a pretty sweet ride.

00:00:41.480 --> 00:00:45.550
David is in Panama, California, Kentucky and Nebraska.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.070
David has his own camp.

00:00:47.380 --> 00:00:50.730
He's a work of art, and a best friend.

00:00:50.830 --> 00:00:54.290
Thanks David... or Dave...whatever it is you go by these days.

